{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CPM0IYrEmp1794399903.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>將軍澳一名男子維修私家車期間，私家車突然墮下將他壓住。他被救出後送院，最終不治。</p><p></p><p>現場是將軍澳穎禮路。據了解，有人租用這片露天場地，用作日常維修車輛。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.COLLAPSE-1900-1_CLEAN_20261111_195633_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026dWhXws3tvX1794399910.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>現場消息指，下午2時許，一名男子懷疑維修私家車期間，私家車突然墮下，將他壓住。其他人用「千斤頂」，將該名72歲本地男子救出，並且報警。</p><p></p><p>救護員到場後，事主已經昏迷，他被送往將軍澳醫院，搶救後不治。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T13:38:57.109191+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T12:22:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T16:37:35.189969+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T13:32:17.938822+00:00","content_hash":"89beaca14557c36ecb7c9bc32f0496570d3198d971a0987a2953da2d42b2353e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T13:38:57.109191+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}